# ===========================================================================
# Build output - never commit generated firmware.
#
# The build directories hold .elf/.hex/.bin/.map plus hundreds of .o files;
# they were 1.9 MB of a 4.1 MB working tree. Firmware images are rebuilt from
# source by any of the three build paths, so committing them would only add
# noise and (worse) invite flashing a stale image.
# ===========================================================================
build/
build-sim/
build-test/
Build/
BuildMCP/

*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.hex
*.bin
*.map
*.su
*.lst

# ===========================================================================
# Keil MDK intermediates
# ===========================================================================
MDK-ARM/Objects/
MDK-ARM/Listings/
MDK-ARM/DebugConfig/
MDK-ARM/RTE/
*.uvguix.*
*.uvoptx
*.bak
*.dep
*.crf
*.lnp
*.iex
*.htm
*.build_log.htm
*.scvd
JLinkLog.txt
keilkill.bat

# ===========================================================================
# Editor / OS
# ===========================================================================
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ===========================================================================
# Python (tools/gen-hardware.py generates hardware/ artifacts)
# ===========================================================================
__pycache__/
*.pyc
